## Existing demo behaviour unchanged (real DOM events)

The same interaction sequence ran at a mobile (390), a compact (768) and the desktop (1440) width:

```
390:  ArrowRight +16 px; pointer drag moved card B by +20 px and stopped at the world-edge clamp
      (home x 160, limit x 180 -> +20 of the +40 requested, i.e. clamping still works);
      edge redrawn, viewBox "0 0 356 744"; zoom-in scale(1.1); fit scale(1); Home back to
      a 17/954, b 177/1482
768:  ArrowRight +16 px; drag +40 px; edge redrawn, viewBox "0 0 718 784"; zoom-in 1.1; fit 1;
      Home back to a 41/705, b 505/1265
1440: ArrowRight +16 px; drag +40 px; edge redrawn, viewBox "0 0 1134 358"; zoom-in 1.1; fit 1;
      Home back to a 185/553, b 1017/745
```

Toolbar click (1440, desktop): clicking "palette" sets only its `aria-pressed` to `true`, the status
line reads `Tool Palette selected. Preview only: no canvas action.`, and the cards stay exactly where
they were. Tab order is toolbar note…table, card A, card B, zoom in/out/fit, then the static
component samples.

## Toolbar and zone properties (computed styles)

```
toolbar: border-radius 9999px (--radius-pill), background rgb(26, 29, 26) (--surface),
         padding 8px (--space-8), gap 4px (--space-4), border 1px (--border), box-shadow --shadow,
         z-index 8 (--layer-canvas-chrome); compact: static grid row, margin-block --space-12,
         single row 54 px / wrapped 94 px
button:  36x36 (--button-bar), border-radius 14px (--radius-md), icon 20x20 (--icon-bar)
divider: 1px x 20px (--border-width x --icon-bar), background rgba(255,255,255,0.08) (--border)
zone:    background rgb(32, 36, 32) (--card), border-radius 14px (--radius-md), z-index 4 (--layer-blocks)
image:   object-fit cover, border-radius 10px (--radius-sm), natural size 1135x829, src
         assets/demo-zone-image.webp (relative local path, not a data URI and not a remote URL)
```

Tool order and initial selection (`data-demo-tool` / `aria-label` / `data-label` / `aria-pressed`):

```
note        Note tool        Note        true    <- selected initially
source      Link tool        Link        false   (source.svg)
image       Image tool       Image       false
file        File tool        File        false
[divider]
zone        Zone tool        Zone        false
checklist   Checklist tool   Checklist   false
palette     Palette tool     Palette     false
columns     Columns tool     Columns     false
timeline    Timeline tool    Timeline    false
table       Table tool       Table       false
```

All ten icons use the existing `.icon--*` mask classes (`mask-image` resolved for every button, no
`none`), so they only take token colours through `currentColor`. Every button has an English
`aria-label` and a `data-label` tooltip; no native `title` attribute.

## States (CDP `CSS.forcePseudoState`)

```
rest    (Timeline): background transparent, color --muted, border transparent
hover   (Image):    background --faint, color --fg, border --border-strong, tooltip "Image" opacity 1
focus   (File):     outline 2px solid rgb(143,191,175) (--accent), tooltip "File" opacity 1
pressed (Zone):     background --faint, color --fg, transform matrix(0.97, ...) (scale(0.97))
selected(Note):     background --accent-soft, color --accent, border --accent-line
```

