## Values and rules

`grep -nE '#[0-9a-fA-F]{3,8}|rgba?\(|hsla?\(' apps/web/preview/{index.html,preview.css,preview.js}`
returns nothing, so there are no raw colours; every visual value is a `var(--…)` token from
`packages/ui-kit/tokens.css`. There are no new tokens, no off-grid spacing and no numeric z-index in
the new code (the only numeric `z-index: 2` in `preview.css` is the pre-existing sample-board zone, not
part of this change). The toolbar and zone use the layer tokens `--layer-canvas-chrome` and
`--layer-blocks` from `packages/ui-kit/layers.ts`. No external fonts, CDNs or remote images; the one
local owner-supplied photo is the documented exception to the old "no images" note in the README.
English UI text only. `node tools/language-check/index.mjs .` reports `language-check: OK`.

